%% Mei-V2 — Diagram sekuens fitur tahap 3
%% Empat alur kunci: sinkron offline (A+C), unggah foto, audit log (D), tema (E).

sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Teknisi
    participant F as MaintenanceFormScreen
    participant DP as DraftProvider
    participant DQ as DraftQueue (pure)
    participant SP as shared_preferences
    participant CP as connectivity_plus
    participant API as ApiService (Dio)
    participant BE as Laravel

    Note over U,BE: Alur 1 — Sinkron offline (WS A + C)
    U->>F: isi checklist / catatan / kondisi
    F->>DP: autosave debounce 600ms
    DP->>DQ: enqueue(DraftRecord(status=menungguSinkron))
    DP->>SP: setString('meiv.draft_queue.v1', DQ.serialize())
    U->>F: tekan KIRIM
    F->>DP: sinkronSekarang()
    alt online
        DP->>DQ: nextPending(); markSending(uuid)
        DP->>API: POST /maintenance (client_uuid)
        API->>BE: 
        alt 201 / 200
            BE-->>API: data + id_maintenance
            DP->>DQ: onSent(uuid, idMaintenance)
            loop tiap foto draf
                DP->>API: POST /maintenance/{id}/foto (multipart)
                API->>BE: 
                alt 201
                    BE-->>DP: id_foto
                else gagal
                    DP->>DQ: onUploadFailed(uuid, reason)
                end
            end
            DP->>SP: persist
        else 422
            BE-->>DP: errors
            DP->>DQ: onRejected(uuid, errors)
        else 401
            BE-->>DP: 
            DP->>DQ: onUnauthorized(uuid) -> ditahan
            DP-->>U: minta login ulang
        else 403
            DP->>DQ: onRejected(uuid, {'pesan':'Tidak berhak'})
        else 5xx / timeout
            DP->>DQ: onUploadFailed(uuid, reason) -> backoff
        end
    else offline
        DP->>SP: persist (tetap menungguSinkron)
    end
    CP-->>DP: event "online"
    DP->>DQ: nextPending() FIFO (tanpa intervensi)

    Note over U,DQ: Alur 2 — Unggah foto (WS C)
    participant PK as FotoPickerField
    participant PC as photo_compressor
    participant PP as PhotoPolicy (pure)
    U->>PK: Ambil Foto / Pilih Galeri
    PK->>PP: canAdd(currentCount)?
    alt penuh
        PP-->>PK: false -> "maksimum 5 foto"
    else
        PK->>PC: compress(bytes) resize <=1600px
        PC->>PP: acceptSize(len)?
        alt > 5 MB
            PP-->>PK: false -> "ukuran melebihi batas"
        else
            PP-->>PK: true
            PK->>DQ: fotoPaths += path lokal
        end
    end

    Note over U,BE: Alur 3 — Audit Log (WS D)
    participant S as Supervisor/Admin
    participant AS as AuditLogScreen
    participant AP as auditProvider
    participant AR as AuditRepository
    participant AD as AuditDetail (pure)
    participant AA as AuditAksi (pure)
    S->>AS: buka layar
    AS->>AP: muat(filter)
    AP->>AR: getLog(entitas, actor, aksi, dari, sampai, page)
    AR->>API: GET /audit-log?...
    API-->>AR: PagedResult<AuditLogEntry>
    AR-->>AP: data
    AP-->>AS: AsyncValue.data
    AS->>AA: label(aksi) -> badge
    AS->>AD: format(detail) -> ringkasan 1 baris
    S->>AS: tekan "Lihat perubahan"
    AS->>AD: format(detail) -> List<String>
    AS-->>S: dialog baris kunci: lama -> baru

    Note over U,BE: Alur 4 — Tema (WS E)
    participant P as ProfileScreen
    participant TP as themeProvider
    participant M as MaterialApp.router
    participant PS as PaletteSpec (pure)
    participant TH as AppTheme.dark()
    M->>TP: watch(themeModeProvider)
    TP->>SP: getString('meiv.theme_mode')
    TP->>PS: ThemeModeCodec.fromString(raw)
    PS-->>TP: 'light'|'dark'|'system'
    TP-->>M: ThemeMode
    M->>TH: AppTheme.dark()
    TH->>PS: PaletteSpec.dark (ARGB)
    PS-->>TH: nilai -> AppPalette (ThemeExtension)
    U->>P: pilih Terang/Gelap/Sistem
    P->>TP: set(code)
    TP->>SP: setString
    TP-->>M: rebuild (tema berubah)

    Note over U,BE: Alur 5 — Patroli + duplikat + checklist cepat (WS I, J, K, v3.1)
    participant PQ as PatrolQueue (pure)
    participant PS as PatrolScreen
    participant CQ as ChecklistQuickFill (pure)
    participant DT as DraftTemplate (pure)
    U->>PS: buka Mode Patroli (kamera aktif terus)
    loop tiap barcode terdeteksi
        PS->>PQ: add(barcode)
        alt duplikat
            PQ-->>PS: false (item tidak ditambah)
        else baru
            PQ-->>PS: true (overlay ringkas ~1,5 dtk)
            PS->>API: GET /alat/{barcode} (validasi)
            alt 404
                PS->>PQ: tandaiBelumValidasi(barcode) (item tetap ada)
            else 200
                PS->>PQ: tandaiTervalidasi(barcode)
            end
        end
    end
    PQ->>SP: persist (meiv.patrol_queue.v1)
    U->>PS: "Selesai (N alat)" -> "Kerjakan" per item
    PS->>F: buka form maintenance alat tsb
    U->>F: tekan "Semua Baik"
    F->>CQ: markAllOk(items)
    CQ-->>F: N item diisi (angka/teks & isian user tidak disentuh)
    F-->>U: snackbar "N item ditandai Baik"
    U->>F: KIRIM -> draftProvider (antrean A)

    Note over U,BE: Alur 6 — Duplikat laporan (WS K)
    U->>F: aksi "Duplikat" pada laporan milik sendiri
    F->>DT: fromReport(report, buatUuid, waktuDuplikasi=now)
    DT-->>F: DraftRecord baru (client_uuid BARU, fotoPaths kosong)
    F->>DP: enqueue(draf) -> kirim bila online
    DP->>API: POST /maintenance (client_uuid baru)
    API->>BE: 
    BE-->>DP: 201 (laporan baru, bukan replay)

    Note over S,BE: Alur 7 — Bagikan tautan (WS O, halaman publik di luar envelope)
    participant SH as ShareController
    participant BR as Browser eksternal
    S->>AS: tombol "Bagikan Tautan"
    AS->>API: POST /maintenance/{id}/share
    API->>BE: (role:Supervisor,Admin, token Str::random(40))
    BE->>BE: AuditLogger: create/share_link
    BE-->>AS: 201 {url, token}
    AS-->>S: salin clipboard / share_plus
    BR->>BE: GET /share/{token} (TANPA auth, rute web.php)
    BE->>BE: cek revoked_at / expires_at
    alt token valid
        BE-->>BR: 200 HTML read-only (tanpa email/NIP)
    else salah/kedaluwarsa/dicabut
        BE-->>BR: 404 view 'share.invalid'
    end
    S->>AS: cabut tautan
    AS->>API: DELETE /api/v1/share/{token}
    API->>BE: 
    BE-->>AS: 200; GET /share/{token} -> 404
